{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/player_in_well.gif?t=1741259564\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the mysterious house of a witch in this short adventure game to find the answers behind a hunter's quest. A strange presence looms over you, you cannot turn back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique hand-drawn artstyle inspired by <i>Angel's Egg </i>and old fairytales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple puzzles and easy gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the house, read documents and speak to the witch to resolve the dangers inside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive and eerie experience to be finished in one sitting (under an hour)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/combination1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1741259564\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up useful objects in your inventory, use them alone or combined to get through the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/reading1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1741259564\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search around the house to find the writings of its occupants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>God in a Closet is an indie project dreamed by a solo developer/artist.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549350?t=1741259564","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/